0341-negroni-apple80211: Wi-Fi, iOS side part 2: Apple80211 answered in the kernel. SIOCGA80211/SIOCSA80211 on en0
(XNU passes unknown interface ioctls to the interface): gets 1 2 4 9 11 12 13 15 16 19 21 27 43 44 103 207 254, sets
10 (scan) 19 (power) 20 (associate: passphrase, or a PMK as 64 hex digits) 22 (disassociate); events class 6
(KEV_IEEE80211_CLASS) subclass 1: power changed, SSID/BSSID/link changed (32-byte link data), assoc done, scan done.
Root only for every set and for gets 1, 9, 11, 103 (EPERM otherwise; wifid runs as root). Every request logged (who, type, value, length; never SSID or key) for the first negroniwlan_ios_log (400), a
per-type summary 180 s after en0. Layouts as HakiOS read them from IO80211.framework 16.5 (static asserts kept).
Derived from HakiOS hakios.apple80211.c (APSL 2.0, notice kept). Details: patches/xnu/README-wifi.md "0340-0341".

